# Prepare for Battle!

# Starting with only 2 villagers, players will have 25 minutes to build a nation and raise an army. Those armies will then duke it out, and the stronger army will be the victor!
# Compete in 3 Maps, from the peaceful Forest Clearing to the scorching Vibrant Dunes to the dangerous Crumbling Ruins.

# Take down your friends in the ultimate strategy game!
# 2-4 Players

# Featuring:
# -Dynamic Real Time Strategy Gameplay
# -3 Varied Areas to Conquer
# -14 Battle-Ready Units
# -And 18 Unique Buildings!

# DOWNLOAD THE RESOURCE PACK BEFORE PLAYING:
# https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LBrS2JoG8xDoZLumIxdtPjuUyNajVWls/view?usp=sharing﻿

# Exclusively for Java 1.21.6, 1.21.7, and 1.21.8
